# analysis scratch — suffix/infix "tmp" forms leak past the tmp-* prefix guard
# (e.g. hr8800-tmp.json, analyses_tmp2.json). Repo root deploys, so these ship live.
*-tmp.*
*_tmp.*
*_tmp[0-9].*
# full-word "temp" forms (e.g. entries_temp.json) — same leak, spelled out
*-temp.*
*_temp.*
*_temp[0-9].*
